# declaring_cast

cast WREN
  .label "Wren the Fisher"
  .voice female_alto

cast ALEX
  .label "Alex"
  .voice male_tenor

cast MAREN
  .label "Maren the Keeper"

-- meeting

WREN
  This is Maren.
  She kept the bell for forty years.

MAREN { quiet }
  Forty-two.

ALEX
  And now?

MAREN
  Now I keep nothing. The bell does its own remembering.
